              "body": "Community behavioral health clinic, letter to primary care. Visit 1/13/2026.\n\nBaseline ANC from your lab 1/12 normal; CK at his baseline. Clozapine started tonight at 12.5 mg at bedtime. Increase by 12.5 to 25 mg every 3 to 4 days if tolerated, aiming for about 100 mg at bedtime by late February, then reassess. Temperature log twice daily. Weekly CBC with ANC and CK through your standing order; thank you.\n\nSymptoms: daily voices, monitoring beliefs, poor sleep. No SI/HI.\nAllergies: risperidone (NMS), aripiprazole (NMS).\nMeds: clozapine as above (dispensed through the specialty pharmacy)."
